ml_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102984#issuecomment-2667476282","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102984","id":2667476282,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6e_nU6","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-19T04:24:02Z","updated_at":"2025-02-19T04:24:02Z","body":"> @syntaxerror247 my main intentions of this proposal was to add Input actions to the editor. Like run the game when `KEY_VOLUMEUP` pressed. You can add a option in editor settings if user wants this feature. Otherwise it'll work normally.\r\n\r\nI don't think this would be useful. Every time you press the volume up key to play, it would also increase the system volume. If you don’t want it at 100%, you'd have to lower it again, which would be annoying. We also can't override it for the editor, as that would prevent users from adjusting the volume inside it. So, I don’t see how this would work.\r\n\r\n> Edit: also, I have a question it is gonna be a Input event or notification event?\r\n\r\nIt will be an Input event, InputEventKey.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2667476282/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2714591669","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102984#issuecomment-2714591669","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102984","id":2714591669,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hzWG1","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-11T14:42:42Z","updated_at":"2025-03-11T14:42:42Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2714591669/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2822733770","html_